X.SH NAME
Xdpy \- new screen updating routines
X.SH SYNOPSIS
X.nf
X.ft B
Xdpyinit(ttytype, modestring)
Xchar *ttytype, *modestring;
X
Xdpywindow(minrow, maxrow, mincol, maxcol)
Xint minrow, maxrow, mincol, maxcol;
X
